      "action": "Existing native records will not appear automatically. Plan an explicit reviewed import or application mapping; preserve IDs, tenant scope and employee_id references."
    },
    {
      "id": "retained_direct_finance_writers",
      "severity": "high",
      "source": "src/services/invoicesService.ts",
      "finding": "Retained createInvoice/updateInvoice/markInvoiceAsPaid and salesService.createPayment functions perform direct table writes; current accounting UI uses atomic RPCs instead.",
      "action": "Do not loosen RLS/grants to make unused direct writers bypass accounting/stock validation. Confirm call reachability before removing or adapting them."
    }
